| Rev 1.0: 8/01/2014
| - Initial version of the model
| - Model generated from simulations in SPECTRE
| - Model matched to SPICE simulation
| - C_comp although listed in numerical order of value are
|   obtained from varying PVT conditions. For PVT conditions for
